  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed for both physical deceleration (vehicles, machinery) and figurative slowdowns (economic growth, project progress). The opposite is ⟦{加速|かそく}→加速：00198_kasoku⟧ (acceleration).\n\nNot to be confused with the homophone ⟦{原則|げんそく}→原則：11801_gensoku⟧ (principle, general rule).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {減速|げんそく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to decelerate, to slow down\n- {急|きゅう}{減速|げんそく}: sudden deceleration\n- ⟦{経済|けいざい}→経済：01394_keizai⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{減速|げんそく}: economic slowdown\n- {減速|げんそく}⟦{車線|しゃせん}→車線：18949_shasen⟧: deceleration lane",
